# A [A | B] choice with an alternative that can match nothing is
# ambiguous.
# error: opt_choice_empty.grammar:14:12:
# error: [X?] and similar are ambiguous: the body of [...] can match nothing; write [X] or X?
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
s = IDENT [IDENT | (IDENT IDENT)?]
